    "body": "In the current main branch of Python it's changed from \"may not be deleted\" to \"cannot be deleted\".  I've gone for a message that matches both (at the cost of a slight divergence of `test_exceptions` from CPython).\r\n\r\nThis is causing a test failure on the sanitizer runs (although it isn't the significant test failure there).",
